  "entity_type": "person",
  "description": "Carl Cox had another hugely successful Ibiza season in 2026, helming every Sunday night at [UNVRS] for 16 weeks straight. As well as various other big gigs around Europe in between, he also found time to appear as a special guest at some big The Prodigy shows — even playing three-deck vinyl sets at some of them — and playing back to back with everyone from David Guetta to Louie Vega. He put out his rewirings of Vikhtor & Pianoalani’s ‘Legacy’ and Renegade Soundwave’s ‘The Phantom’, while it was also announced in June that he was receiving an OBE medal for services to music. All hail King Carl!",
